{
  "calendar": "CN",
  "about": "Onshore renminbi (CNY) settlement closures (Beijing; CFETS and CNAPS), 2008-2026: the weekdays off in each year's State Council General Office notice on holiday arrangements (国务院办公厅关于部分节假日安排的通知), which sets the days off and the make-up working days a year ahead. The make-up working days are Saturdays or Sundays, so they don't open a weekday and are left out (CFETS trades on them; settlement doesn't run). Each holiday is a table of its weekday dates, and there are no rules past the latest notice. One-off: 3-4 September 2015 (70th anniversary of the war's end). Matches the vacanza holidays library's China table for every year 2008-2026 and the 2026 notice (Xinhua, 2025-11-04). Coverage ends at the latest notice (2026; 2027's is due in November).",
